<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Utilities raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Texas Utilities raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Texas Utilities Co to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Texas Utilities gained 1-1/2 to 36-7/8.</p>
</text>
